     "description": "ice layer bulk salinity, prescribed by the salinity profile module (icepack_salinity.F90; the default 'constant' profile); the mushy thermodynamics uses it for the liquidus, liquid fraction, and enthalpy, [ppt]"
    },
    "hpnd": {
     "type": "parameter",
