     "description": "Instantaneous pin of the dEdd snow fraction against cice_albedo.csv row (step 1, i=2, j=4, ncat 1): with vsnon = 0 the snow depth hs = vsnon/aicen = 0 < hs_min = 1e-4, so shortwave_dEdd_set_snow (icepack_shortwave.F90:3451-3454) leaves fs = 0 and the dumped snowfracn = 0. The apeffn input path is identically 0 (hpnd = apnd = 0), so snowfracn = min(fs, 1 - apeffn) = 0 exactly.",
